{
  "CharacterId": 10120,
  "DialogJP": [
    {
      "Id": 101200010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ハンマーを握ると"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "世のすべてが釘に見え"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ドラムスティックを握れば"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "世のすべてがドラムに見えてくる"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200050,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "……ストレス溜まってる？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "練習大変……？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ノンノン"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "これは「ドラマー」柚鳥ナツの感想"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "……だけど、それも悪くないかも"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "じゃあ、例のお店に集合～"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200110,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "え？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "芸術が人生なのではない"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "人生が芸術なのだ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "時には他の芸術に触れることも肝要……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "じゃあ、映画館に集合～"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "え？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "あ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "まはやさあさ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "せんうせたやく"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "れんしゅっ室"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "はやく"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "え！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "力を出すために"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "力を抜かなければならないなんて"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "このアンチノミーも、ドラマーの背負うべき宿命なのか……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "え……？"
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Id": 101200010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "망치를 쥐면"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "세상 모든 문제가 못으로 보이는 법."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "드럼 스틱을 쥐니"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "세상 모든 게 두들길 것으로 보이네."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200050,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "…혹시 스트레스를 풀 뭔가가 필요한 거야?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "혹시 뭔가 두들길 게 필요한 거야……?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "아냐 아냐, 선생님."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "이것은 '드러머' 유토리 나츠로서의 감상."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "하지만 스트레스 해소라는 핑계도 좋은 것 같군."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "그러니까 그 가게 앞에서 보자고."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200110,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "네?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "예술이 인생을 모방하는 것이 아니라"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "인생이 예술을 모방하는 것."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "그런 의미에서 견학이 필요해 선생님."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "그러니까 그 영화관 앞에서 보자고."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "네?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "아"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "아ㅏㅏ아아ㅏ아"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "선생니ㅁ. 긴급. 연"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "연습실로"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "빨리"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "어?!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "힘을 내기 위해서"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "힘을 빼야 한다니"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "이 안티노미 또한 드러머가 짊어져야 할 숙명인 것일까……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "……?"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Id": 101200010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "If you wield a hammer"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "every problem becomes a nail"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "When I hold drumsticks"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "everything in the world looks like it can be hit"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200050,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "...Do you need to relieve your stress?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Would you like something to hit...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Oh, Sensei..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm simply describing how I currently feel."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "But...perhaps I am a little stressed."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "So meet me in front of our spot."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200110,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Art does not imitate life."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Life imitates art, right?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei, I need a study trip."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "So meet me in front of the movie theater."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "AAAAAA"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei. Emergency!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "practice room"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "HURRY"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "Huh?!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "To exert power"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "one must exhaust power"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Is this antinomy the fate of all drummers?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "...?"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Id": 101200010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ถ้ามีค้อนอยู่ในมือ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ปัญหาทุกอย่างในโลกนี้ก็จะดูจ้อยร่อย\nเหมือนตะปู"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แต่พอมาถือไม้กลองแบบนี้"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ทุกอย่างในโลกก็ดูน่าตื่นเต้นไปหมด\nเลยละ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200050,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "อยากได้อะไรคลายเครียดหน่อยมั้ย?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "หรืออยากได้อะไรมาเคาะเล่น...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "เปล่าๆ เปล่าหรอกคุณครู"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "มันเป็นความประทับใจของยูโทริ นัตสึ\nในฐานะ 'มือกลอง' น่ะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แต่เรื่องการคลายเครียดก็เป็นข้ออ้าง\nที่ดีเหมือนกัน"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "งั้นไปเจอกันที่หน้าร้านนั้นนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200110,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "อะไรนะ?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ไม่ใช่ว่าศิลปะเลียนแบบชีวิตหรอก"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แต่ชีวิตต่างหากที่เลียนแบบงานศิลป์"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "แสดงว่าเราจำเป็นต้องออกไปสั่งสม\nประสบการณ์ชีวิตนะ คุณครู"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "งั้นเดี๋ยวเจอกันหน้าโรงหนังนะ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "ว่าไงนะ?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อ่า"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "อ๊าาาาา"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "คูมคู มี เรื่อง ฉุกเฉิน"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "มาที่"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ห้องซ้อมเร็ว"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "เอ๋?!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ต้องผ่อนแรงลง"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "เพื่อให้มีแรงมากขึ้น"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ชีวิตของมือกลองมีชะตากรรมที่ต้อง\nเผชิญความขัดแย้งแบบนี้ด้วยหรือ..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "...?"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTW": [
    {
      "Id": 101200010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "手握鐵鎚時"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200020,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "世間的所有問題看起來都像釘子"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "而當手握鼓棒時"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "世間的一切都像能敲打的東西呢"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200050,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "……難道你需要找東西發洩壓力？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "還是你只是想找個東西來敲……？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200070,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "非也非也，老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200080,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "這是「鼓手」柚鳥夏的感想"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200090,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "不過拿紓壓當藉口似乎也不錯"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200100,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "那麼，就在那間店門口見吧"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200110,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200120,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "不是藝術模仿人生"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "而是人生模仿藝術"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200140,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "從這個角度來說，是否該實地考察一下呢，老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200150,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "那麼，就在那間電影院門口見吧"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200160,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊啊啊啊啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師你快"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "來練習室"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "快點"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200220,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "咦！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "為了使出力量"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "就必須先放下力量"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "這種矛盾，難道是鼓手必須背負的宿命嗎……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101200260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "……？"
    }
  ]
}